Kapomir fork modifications, 2026-11-19:
- Correct name validation and safe mod-directory renaming on macOS.
- Custom image import and decoded, full-width thumbnail layout.
- Separate release notes and application logs in the Updates panel.
- Editable descriptions stored as manager metadata, preserving game files,
  technical details, original credits and all other metadata fields.
- Apple silicon/Rosetta launch preflight and error recovery without game-content repair.
- Independent Home thumbnail/background framing and a replacement for the old arrows.
- Per-mod cover framing with drag, zoom and fit, preserving source images.
- Fork-specific version labels and manual updates from this fork.

